# `core.autocrlf=true` is set globally on this machine, which rewrites LF to CRLF
# on checkout. Vite's transform chokes on CRLF in some .mjs files — it fails at
# import time with `SyntaxError: Invalid or unexpected token`, while `node --check`
# and bare `node` accept the same file. That silently dropped two whole test suites
# (result + delegate-worker) from the run. `text=auto eol=lf` overrides autocrlf
# for this repo, so a fresh clone cannot reintroduce the problem.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must not touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
